# Hugging Face access token (required for Llama 3 weights)
# 1. Create token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 2. Accept Llama 3 license at https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct
# 3. Run: huggingface-cli login
#    (or set HF_TOKEN below)

# HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here
